        "detailed_description": "Step into the chilling world of <strong>Whispering Death</strong>, a survival horror game with intricate puzzle elements that will keep you on the edge of your seat. In this game, you play as a man who wakes up in a nightmarish realm, stripped of his memories and haunted by the unknown. Your goal is to remember who you are and find a way out of this terrifying place.<br><br>Navigate through a frightful environment teeming with monstrous creatures and sinister entities that thirst for your demise. The game masterfully blends storytelling, and puzzle-solving, ensuring a gripping experience that challenges both your wits and nerves.<br><br><strong>Whispering Death</strong> stands out with its procedurally generated items, offering players a unique experience each time they play. This feature ensures that no two playthroughs are the same, demanding new strategies and approaches every time you dive into the horror.<br><br><strong>Prepare yourself for a survival horror experience like no other, where every corner hides a new threat and every step could be your last.</strong>",
        "about_the_game": "Step into the chilling world of <strong>Whispering Death</strong>, a survival horror game with intricate puzzle elements that will keep you on the edge of your seat. In this game, you play as a man who wakes up in a nightmarish realm, stripped of his memories and haunted by the unknown. Your goal is to remember who you are and find a way out of this terrifying place.<br><br>Navigate through a frightful environment teeming with monstrous creatures and sinister entities that thirst for your demise. The game masterfully blends storytelling, and puzzle-solving, ensuring a gripping experience that challenges both your wits and nerves.<br><br><strong>Whispering Death</strong> stands out with its procedurally generated items, offering players a unique experience each time they play. This feature ensures that no two playthroughs are the same, demanding new strategies and approaches every time you dive into the horror.<br><br><strong>Prepare yourself for a survival horror experience like no other, where every corner hides a new threat and every step could be your last.</strong>",
        "short_description": "Whispering Death: Prologue draws you into a twisted world built from the remnants of your past. Solve puzzles, search for answers, and stay alert - She’s always watching, and one wrong decision can end everything.",
